# Pairs with AuthorizeBeforeDisclose. The posture answers while the flag is
# off, so it is exactly the verb that would disclose the flag if it skipped
# authorization.
MODULE: PostureSkipsAdminCheck
TARGET: AuthorizeBeforeDisclose
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the posture verb answers an unauthorized caller
PERTURBS: Posture

--- FIND
    IN IF ~auth THEN Refuse("posture", auth, fl, "denied", FALSE)
--- REPLACE
    IN IF FALSE THEN Refuse("posture", auth, fl, "denied", FALSE)
--- END
